ve the right to protect my own privacy."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":14,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Interrogator","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"According to the statements given by other commanders, you have had multiple heated arguments with Commander Novikov. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Testimony shows that you have threatened to kill him before."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"He had bugged and spied on me repeatedly in the past and shamelessly feigned innocence when I found out. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I have found listening devices installed around me on at least five occasions."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Interrogator","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But you didn't have proof that he was the one behind the bugs, so Griffin decided not to pass judgment on him."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"He always did a clean job. He was no amateur."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Interrogator","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It would seem that Commander Novikov had knowledge that could cost him his life. Does it have anything to do with your \"personal matter\"?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":13,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You already consider me the culprit, so you're trying to trick me into letting something slip?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":13,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Interrogator","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't be testy, Commander Angelia. I am just making reasonable assumptions and routine inquiries."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":14,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Novikov's death has nothing to do with me. He was no more than an irritating fly to me. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I have more important things to do than worry about being harassed by a fly."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":14,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Interrogator","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Your \"personal matter\" seems to be quite the priority for you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":14,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let me say this again."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange's patience has reached its limit."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":13,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My personal matter is completely irrelevant to this case. Besides, I have an alibi."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":13,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Interrogator","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Your alibi cannot be entirely verified unless you are willing to explain the missing link."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange clenches her fists and fights the urge to punch this man's aggravating face."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":14,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":14,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Interrogator","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Taking in Ange's silence, the interrogator turns the desk lamp and shines its light directly into Ange's face. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The piercing light makes her narrow her eyes."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Interrogator","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I see that you're determined to make this difficult."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":13,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":13,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Interrogator","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Perhaps you have your own reasons that you cannot speak of, or perhaps you're just putting up some last-ditch resistance. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But whichever the case, I'm sorry to inform you that until your innocence can be proven, you will be stripped of your duties and confined to the Griffin base. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Any attempt to leave the base will be considered abscondment."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":14,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosit