ion. Please cease everything you're doing and cooperate with the investigation."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":14,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm coming."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The shouting from outside the door continues to grate on Ange's ears. She is just about to put away the micro-communicator when AN-94 pipes up a bit anxiously."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, we just discovered new traces of another break-in.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They seem to be older than the other traces, but definitely left by the same people.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":10,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Good. Keep looking."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"94, cover me. They're right—","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Explo_Close","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Boom!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange does a double-take at the sudden loud noise."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ange